<title>USA: CKE Restaurants OKs 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>CKE Restaurants OKs 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKE Restaurants Inc said Thursday that its board has approved a three-for-two split of its common stock to be effected as a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed January 12 to stockholders of record January 2, the company said. Cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares based on the closing price on the record date.</p>
</text>
